WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:16.186
Jason watched the rain from the window.

2
00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:18.834
Kids Central was inside today.

3
00:00:18.835 --> 00:00:22.037
It was too wet to go outside.

4
00:00:22.038 --> 00:00:27.319
"The rain is melting all the snow," Izzie said sadly.

5
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:35.386
Jason sighed. "It's not supposed to rain in December."

6
00:00:35.387 --> 00:00:40.085
"Cheer up, gloomy students. It's December.

7
00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:44.558
It will snow again soon," Miss Shelly said.

8
00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:49.315
"Today we're making something that will make all your mouths smile.

9
00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:54.452
We're making chocolate tofu pudding!"

10
00:00:54.453 --> 00:01:00.800
Jason cheered. "So there's no milk in it, right?" he asked.

11
00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:02.673
Miss Shelly nodded.

12
00:01:02.674 --> 00:01:07.398
"Just tofu, cocoa powder, banana, and sugar."

13
00:01:07.399 --> 00:01:12.603
Bobby groaned. "Tofu? Ew!"

14
00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:17.366
"Have you eaten tofu before, Bobby?" Miss Shelly asked.

15
00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:19.542
Bobby shook his head.

16
00:01:19.543 --> 00:01:24.059
"Then it will be fun to try something new," Miss Shelly said.

17
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.275
Jason looked at the table.

18
00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:30.359
"How do we make it?"

19
00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:37.274
"Put on your aprons, and I'll show you," she said.

20
00:01:37.275 --> 00:01:39.837
"It's going to be gross,"

21
00:01:39.838 --> 00:01:43.070
Bobby said, making a face.

22
00:01:43.071 --> 00:01:47.764
"Bobby." Miss Shelly gave him a warning look.

23
00:01:47.765 --> 00:01:49.683
"It's good, okay?

24
00:01:49.684 --> 00:01:52.652
Just give it a try," Jason said.

25
00:01:52.653 --> 00:01:56.252
"I love tofu!" Nina said.

26
00:01:56.253 --> 00:02:00.466
"Jason, start us off," Miss Shelly said.

27
00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:04.656
"Drain one package of tofu," Jason read.

28
00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.913
"Put it in the blender."

29
00:02:06.914 --> 00:02:11.002
"What does drain the tofu mean?" Izzie asked.

30
00:02:11.003 --> 00:02:18.022
"It means dump out the water," Jason answered.

31
00:02:18.023 --> 00:02:22.692
"Add one ripe banana," Izzie read next.

32
00:02:22.693 --> 00:02:24.780
"Add cocoa powder."

33
00:02:24.781 --> 00:02:28.229
Ethan put the cocoa in the blender.

34
00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:31.834
"And sugar," said Nina.

35
00:02:31.835 --> 00:02:36.801
"Blend until smooth," Bobby said.

36
00:02:36.802 --> 00:02:41.321
"Can I hit the blend button?"

37
00:02:41.322 --> 00:02:44.030
The blender buzzed and hummed.

38
00:02:44.031 --> 00:02:48.809
It was very noisy at first, but then it got quiet.

39
00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:52.063
"What do we do?" Bobby asked.

40
00:02:52.064 --> 00:02:55.533
"The blender's on, but it's not blending!

41
00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:58.313
The pudding stopped moving."

42
00:02:58.314 --> 00:03:00.108
"Turn it off.

43
00:03:00.109 --> 00:03:02.845
Scrape the sides with this."

44
00:03:02.846 --> 00:03:05.523
Miss Shelly handed him a spoon.

45
00:03:05.524 --> 00:03:08.589
"Then blend again."

46
00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:13.431
Bobby followed the instructions.

47
00:03:13.432 --> 00:03:18.143
When he turned the blender back on, the pudding swirled around.

48
00:03:18.144 --> 00:03:21.324
"I think it's done!" Jason called.

49
00:03:21.325 --> 00:03:23.421
"Turn off the blender.

50
00:03:23.422 --> 00:03:26.151
Each of you, take a paper cup.

51
00:03:26.152 --> 00:03:28.590
Pour the pudding into the cup.

52
00:03:28.591 --> 00:03:37.722
We have to refrigerate the pudding for about thirty minutes," Miss Shelly said.

53
00:03:37.723 --> 00:03:42.523
Miss Shelly carried the tray of cups to the refrigerator.

54
00:03:42.524 --> 00:03:47.083
The kids played basketball in the gym.

55
00:03:47.084 --> 00:03:50.042
Soon it was almost time to go home.

56
00:03:50.043 --> 00:03:54.867
Ms. Folani, the principal, stuck her head in the door.

57
00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:59.141
"These had your name on them in the refrigerator," she said.

58
00:03:59.142 --> 00:04:03.233
"Our pudding!" Izzie cried.

59
00:04:03.234 --> 00:04:07.918
Everyone gathered at the table and grabbed a cup.

60
00:04:07.919 --> 00:04:12.118
"Mmm," Jason said with a mouthful of pudding.

61
00:04:12.119 --> 00:04:14.014
"This is good."

62
00:04:14.015 --> 00:04:17.199
"It smells funny," Bobby said.

63
00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.517
He sniffed his cup.

64
00:04:19.518 --> 00:04:24.198
"Just try it," Jason said, rolling his eyes.

65
00:04:24.199 --> 00:04:27.083
"It tastes good."

66
00:04:27.084 --> 00:04:33.603
Bobby spooned some pudding into his mouth.

67
00:04:33.604 --> 00:04:38.728
"Wait, this tastes like chocolate pudding!" he said.

68
00:04:38.729 --> 00:04:43.597
"That's because it is chocolate pudding, dummy," Jason said.

69
00:04:43.598 --> 00:04:45.896
Jason turned to Miss Shelly.

70
00:04:45.897 --> 00:04:48.613
"Thanks for the pudding," he said.

71
00:04:48.614 --> 00:04:52.840
Miss Shelly smiled. "You're welcome, Jason."

72
00:04:52.841 --> 00:04:56.892
"Thanks for making me try tofu," Bobby said.

73
00:04:56.893 --> 00:05:03.713
"It's not so bad."
